	(text "NOTE: \nIS31FL373Ω is powered from the +5V rail to allow for higher voltage LEDs. The I2C bus operates\nnatively at 3.3V. This logic mismatch is validated. The minimum High-Level Input Voltage V{IH}\nof 1.4V. The 3.3V logic exceeds this threshold. A level shifter is intentionally omitted."
